{"games":[{"id":15316683107,"name":"The Nearly Impossible Obby","desc":"Challenge your skills in The Nearly Impossible Obby, a thrilling platformer adventure with 265 stages of escalating difficulty. Do you have what it takes to conquer all of the obstacles and emerge the Obby Master? Only 1% can, good luck...\n\nLiking the game but it gets too difficult for you? No worries, once you have completed at least 60 stages—you can Rebirth for gems allowing you to unlock unique trails and halos. In addition, you can compete for a spot on the Rebirth leaderboard!\n\nPress R to go back to your stage, or Y if you are on controller. \n\nTags: Obby, Parkour, Platformer, Obstacle Course, Tower, Easy, Hard, Impossible, Difficulty Chart, DCO, Lava","path":"/game/15316683107-the-nearly-impossible-obby","slug":"15316683107-the-nearly-impossible-obby","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-86bd9852cd51ed65ee6277390bf21fc6/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://scriptblox.com/images/no-script.webp","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":17,"visitor":32521724,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-11-08T14:59:42.839Z","creator":{"name":"Big Dream Studios.","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7411558263,"name":"Pass The Bomb 💣","desc":"Play an intense match of running away from the bomb and try not to get exploded! 💣\n\n🏃‍♂️ Run away from the person holding the bomb!\n💣 If you have the bomb catch anyone to pass them the bomb!\n❎ No breaks! Play fast paced and beat other players!\n⏰ Updates coming regularly! Make sure to look out!\n🫂 Join the group to get exclusive rewards in the future! \n\n👍 Make sure to like the game and favorite it for frequent updates! 👍 \n\n🔥 Like the game for perks 🔥\n\n🐦 Join the group for better bomb accuracy! 🐦","path":"/game/7411558263-pass-the-bomb","slug":"7411558263-pass-the-bomb","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6bd0da84c4e8643076ff7910e42dc3a4/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180D